&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Enablement team supports the adoption of AI capabilities across Raisin’s products and internal systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team focuses on establishing a consistent and reliable approach to using AI in production by providing shared foundations, guidance, and reusable solutions. This includes working with engineering teams to integrate AI into existing systems, ensuring solutions are scalable, maintainable, and aligned with security and regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The scope ranges from improving internal workflows to enabling new product capabilities, depending on where AI can deliver measurable value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an AI Engineer, you will help shape how AI is applied across the organization by combining hands-on engineering with enablement and guidance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable teams to adopt AI effectively&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with product and engineering teams to identify and refine AI use cases&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support teams in integrating AI capabilities into their systems and workflows by providing clear guidance on patterns, trade-offs, and practical implementation approaches&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote consistent and reusable solutions to reduce fragmentation across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to shared capabilities where needed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop or extend shared components, integrations, or services when required to unblock teams&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and implement patterns for integrating LLM capabilities into the platform&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to shared components or lightweight services that simplify access to AI capabilities across teams&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage AI costs and budget usage when providing shared model access and services to other teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support teams in developing retrieval-based approaches that make internal knowledge accessible to AI-driven use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide technical decisions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate tools, platforms, and approaches with consideration for scalability, security, and maintainability&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help teams choose appropriate solutions based on context rather than applying AI by default&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to establishing a pragmatic and consistent approach to AI usage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure robustness and responsible usage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize AI system efficiency by making principled model selections based on cost-performance trade-offs, inference latency, and token usage optimization&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the implementation of safeguards such as access controls, validation, and monitoring&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Security, Legal, and other stakeholders on requirements related to AI usage&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to practices that ensure solutions are reliable and aligned with internal standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience as a Software Engineer (5+ years), with focus on backend or platform development&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong generalist mindset, comfortable working across technical domains&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on production systems and collaborating across teams&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in environments with evolving scope and priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one programming language (Python preferred; JVM languages also relevant)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud environments (AWS preferred)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of APIs, system integration, and distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience working with AI tools or platforms (e.g. LLM APIs or similar technologies)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with concepts such as prompt design, context engineering, retrieval-based approaches, or AI-driven workflows&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to assess where AI adds value and where it does not&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt; Find more  English Speaking Jobs in Germany  on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;Sr. Software Engineer&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Team + The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pendo&#39;s engineering teams build the product experiences that help customers understand, improve, and act on product usage data. This team is focused on AI-powered features that turn raw usage signals into automatic, actionable suggestions, reducing the manual work customers need to do before they can get value from Pendo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you will help shape and ship intelligent product experiences from discovery through delivery. You will work full-stack with a lean toward frontend, using TypeScript, Vue.js, backend services, and AI coding tools to build high-quality features on a small, fast-moving team. This role also owns product judgment: validating problems with customers, sizing opportunities, defining success metrics, and making pragmatic tradeoffs in ambiguous spaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Sheffield office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What this looks like day-to-day&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-powered feature delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and ship features that use AI to turn product usage data into actionable suggestions for customers. You will work end to end across the experience, with attention to quality, usability, and the unique failure modes of AI-backed products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-stack engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Own delivery across the frontend and backend, with a strong lean toward TypeScript, Vue.js, DOM-level work, component architecture, and in-browser data capture. You will reason about backend services and APIs while building polished, reliable customer-facing experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Help validate problems, shape scope, and test direction before and while building. You will join customer calls, test prototypes, and use real feedback to make sure the team is solving meaningful problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success metrics and iteration:&lt;/strong&gt; Define what success looks like for the features you build and use product usage data to guide iteration. You will not just close tickets; you will measure whether the work is creating the intended customer impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-enabled development:&lt;/strong&gt; Use AI coding tools such as Cursor and Claude Code as a core part of your daily workflow. You will apply strong engineering judgment, review rigor, and accountability to AI-generated code just as you would to your own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI product quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Ship AI-backed features with careful attention to latency, hallucination, inconsistent output, and user trust. You will help ensure intelligent experiences are useful, understandable, and reliable for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with product, design, and fellow engineers in a small team where ownership and leverage matter. You will help make pragmatic tradeoffs against ambiguous, fast-moving requirements instead of waiting for a fully defined spec.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Raise the quality of the team through code review, mentorship, and unblocking teammates. You will communicate clearly, share context, and help others grow while keeping delivery moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond the qualifications, we hire through a specific lens. These aren&#39;t buzzwords; they&#39;re the things we&#39;ll actually look for in how you talk about your work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a builder, not a maintainer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re most energized when there isn&#39;t a clear path yet, and you get to define it. You don&#39;t wait for direction; you identify gaps, shape solutions, and drive them forward. At Pendo, great Senior Software Engineers don&#39;t just follow instructions; they operate as strategic advisors, influencing decisions, guiding stakeholders, and elevating how we work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re AI-curious - genuinely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re not using AI tools occasionally. You&#39;re rewiring how you work around them. You&#39;re faster, sharper, and more prolific because of it, and you bring that energy to everything — how you approach your work, how you prep, how you communicate, how you think. We want someone who sees AI as a multiplier, not a shortcut.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building with LLMs and AI agents, whether through production work or personal projects. You have built something with these technologies, not just used them as tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-stack engineering experience with a frontend lean, including strong TypeScript skills, comfort working with the DOM, and the ability to reason about backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience building and scaling web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product judgment, including comfort owning ambiguous problems, shaping scope, and making decisions without a fully specified brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining success metrics for a feature and iterating based on real usage data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging directly with customers or end users to validate problems and assess impact after launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of software architecture, design principles, and API development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication skills and the ability to mentor others, unblock teammates, and support the growth of the engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working as, or closely alongside, a product manager, including writing specs, prioritizing a roadmap, or running discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with product analytics tools such as Pendo, Amplitude, or Mixpanel to measure feature impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or running experiments, including A/B tests or betas, to validate product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with browser DOM inspection or automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Model Context Protocol or building tools for LLM agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with real-time data pipelines or streaming architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accessibility experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for continuous learning and sharing insights with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About Pendo&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pendo was founded in 2013 by former product managers, who combined their heads and hearts to build something they wanted but never had as product managers: a simple way to understand and attack what truly drives product success. Our mission is to improve society&#39;s experience with software. Come join one of the fastest-growing startups, supported by best-in-class institutions like Battery Ventures, Salesforce Ventures, Spark Capital and Meritech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pendo Core Values:&lt;/strong&gt; Bias to Act, Hone Your Craft, The Team is Pendo, and Maniacal Focus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Pendo is a hybrid culture. In-office 3 days per week unless designated remote.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt; The expected salary range for this role to be performed in Sheffield, United Kingdom is £60,000 - £78,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive, top-tier coverage in the United Kingdom, including medical, dental, and life coverage, combined with pension match, equity, and high-value lifestyle perks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEOC:&lt;/strong&gt; We are an equal opportunity employer and believe having diverse teams where everyone brings their whole self to Pendo is key to our success. We welcome all people of different backgrounds, experiences, abilities and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accessibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Pendo is committed to working with, and providing access and reasonable accommodation to, applicants with mental and/or physical disabilities. If you think you may require an accommodation for any part of the recruitment process, please send a request to: ----- All requests for accommodations are treated discreetly and confidentially, as practical and permitted by law.&lt;/p&gt; Find more  English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom  on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;Who We Are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions is the enterprise technology and transformation capability of WPP, delivering data, AI, and modern applications for the world&#39;s leading brands. We partner with AWS to bring these capabilities to blue-chip clients. WPP Enterprise Solutions signed a multi-year Strategic Collaboration Agreement with AWS, and we are building toward AWS Premier Partner status. This role sits at the centre of that growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We are hiring the senior technical voice of our AWS alliance in EMEA. This is the person AWS field leadership and client architects turn to when a deal needs technical credibility, and the person who shapes how we win on AWS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You will own the technical strategy behind our co-sell pursuits: the reference architectures that become client blueprints, the proof points that remove doubt, and the joint solutions that define our AWS partnership. This is a hands-on principal role for someone who wants their architecture decisions to carry weight across a fast-growing alliance, not a task-based delivery seat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;Role Summary&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is a principal-level technical pre-sales role. You are the senior technical authority for AWS co-sell across EMEA. You partner directly with Alliance Sales, Alliance Solution Leads, AWS Solutions Architects, and client engineering teams to win strategic pursuits. You set the technical direction, and you bring the depth to back it up in the room.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is an individual contributor role with senior influence. You will mentor delivery teams and shape technical standards, but your primary impact is winning the pursuits that grow the alliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;What You Will Own&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical leadership on strategic pursuits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;serve as the senior technical partner on priority AWS co-sell opportunities. Set the technical win strategy, lead client-facing deep-dives alongside AWS SAs, and remove the objections that decide competitive deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reference architectures that become standards:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;design the architectures that anchor our joint AWS solutions and get reused across pursuits. Contribute to AWS Partner Central and establish the patterns delivery teams build from.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proof that converts:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;scope and lead the proof-of-concept work that proves we can deliver, and shape those POCs so they become production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AWS field relationships: &lt;/strong&gt;build trusted relationships with AWS Solutions Architects, Specialist SAs, and ProServe. Be the technical name AWS field teams want on their deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical direction for the alliance:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;advise our leadership and client leadership on AWS architecture strategy. Keep us ahead of AWS roadmaps in priority services, and set the technical bar as the alliance scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot;&gt;Technical Depth&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-sourcepos=&quot;42:1-46:73;3142-3588&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generative AI:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Amazon Bedrock, SageMaker, agentic and generative AI application patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Amazon Marketing Cloud (AMC), AWS Clean Rooms, data lakes, analytics pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Amazon Personalize, Amazon Connect, serverless architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern Applications:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lambda, Step Functions, API Gateway, container orchestration&lt;/li&gt;
